# Keep the build context to source. `data/` matters most: it is real recordings
# of real voices, and a build context is copied wholesale to the daemon — so a
# local `docker build` would ship 51 MB of someone's voice to it even though no
# COPY names it. CI never has the directory (it is gitignored), which is exactly
# why the risk here is local and worth naming.
data/
target/
result
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.angular/
frontend/test-results/
.direnv/
.git/
.DS_Store
